+````markdown name=docs/runbooks/operator_hsm_and_production_rollout.md
+```text
+Operator runbook (condensed) - recommended order
+
+1) HSM activation:
+   - Run ops/hsm/aws_hsm_activation_full.sh <cluster-id> <region> locally as operator (needs AWS CLI, cosign, vault)
+   - Place key refs into Vault staging and obtain auditor signoff
+   - Promote to active and test cosign sign/verify
+   - Record issuance & rotation events via ops/hsm/audit_rotation_log.py
+
+2) Deploy core infra to staging:
+   - Ensure Vault CSI installed and SecretProviderClass configured
+   - Run ops/helm/provision_core_infra_with_vault_csi.sh aegis
+   - Verify MLflow, Milvus, Redis, Prometheus, Grafana
+   - Run ops/backup/drill_restore.sh in staging and validate restores
+
+3) Provision runner hardware:
+   - Provision one GPU/TPU/Neuron host using cloud-init template
+   - Register runner with deploy/selfhosted/tpu_neuron_runner_setup.sh
+   - Run .github/workflows/runner_hw_validation_ci.yml on self-hosted runner and analyze results
+
+4) Moderation & attestation:
+   - Configure MODERATION_PROVIDER and provider creds in Vault
+   - Deploy moderation service and test with services/moderation/test_moderation_integration.py
+
+5) Calibrator & factuality:
+   - Collect labels/mm_labels.csv, mm_holdout.csv
+   - Run .github/workflows/calibrator_push_threshold.yml to compute and push thresholds to Vault
+
+6) Finance shadow & audit:
+   - Start finance shadow cron (services/finance/finance_shadow_multi_month.py) and run for configured window
+   - Prepare audit binder and request insurer signoff using services/finance/prepare_audit_binder.py
+
+7) Policy coverage:
+   - Use services/policy/extract_policy_actions.py to generate CSV, expand, and assert policy engine via CI
+
+8) Scale generative serving:
+   - Deploy Triton/vLLM, warm-pool, and run scale tests; tune batch/worker sizes and GPU reservations
+````
